  <text x="95" y="112" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--fg-muted)">package.nix</text>
  <path d="M 170 98 L 250 98" stroke="var(--fg-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="210" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--fg-faint)">merge</text>
  <rect x="250" y="70" width="130" height="56" rx="10" fill="var(--code)" stroke="var(--rule)" />
  <text x="315" y="102" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--fg)">flake</text>
  <path d="M 380 98 L 460 40" stroke="var(--fg-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" />
  <path d="M 380 98 L 460 98" stroke="var(--fg-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" />
  <path d="M 380 98 L 460 156" stroke="var(--fg-faint)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" />
  <text x="465" y="44" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--status-load-bearing)">nix run .#notify</text>
  <text x="465" y="102" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--status-load-bearing)">nix run .#notify</text>
  <text x="465" y="160" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--status-load-bearing)">nix run .#notify</text>
</svg>

That is the bet of the whole repo: one repo everyone can edit is the
fastest way for all of us to move. Browse what has accumulated under
[`packages/`](https://github.com/indexable-inc/index/tree/main/packages).
